        ":question/id": "fd331529-f190-56d9-afa5-df2361ebb88a",
        ":question/problem": "If $\\overset{\\to }{v} = ⟨8,-5⟩$, then $5\\overset{\\to }{v} =$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5\\overset{\\to }{v} &= 5\\cdot ⟨8,-5⟩ \\\\ &= ⟨5\\cdot 8,5\\cdot (-5)⟩ \\\\ &= ⟨40,-25⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$"
